WEBVTT

00:00:01.580 --> 00:00:03.710
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:00:03.870 --> 00:00:05.670
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:00:06.210 --> 00:00:08.730
<b>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</b>

00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:20.470
<b>Kinou made no ruuru kyou wa tada no ruuzu</b>

00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:20.470
<i>Yesterday’s rules are simply loose today</i>

00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:24.770
<b>Kowashite dantotsu gooru</b>

00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:24.770
<i>The best goal is to break them</i>

00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:27.560
<b>hashiri tudukete nai to</b>

00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:27.560
<i>If I don’t keep running</i>

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:29.900
<b>hokani imi wa nai to</b>

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:29.900
<i>There’s no other meaning</i>

00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:34.240
<b>Panku na tetsukaku nanda</b>

00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:34.240
<i>It’s a punk philosophy</i>

00:00:34.610 --> 00:00:39.330
<b>Baiorizumu wa tsuubai rizumu de</b>

00:00:34.610 --> 00:00:39.330
<i>Biorhythm is a two-time rhythm</i>

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:43.460
<b>Fuukei wa shunkan ni musuu no sen</b>

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:43.460
<i>The scenery instantly becomes countless lines</i>

00:00:43.460 --> 00:00:46.330
<b>Ore wo torimaku kaze</b>

00:00:43.460 --> 00:00:46.330
<i>The wind envelops me</i>

00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:51.050
<b>Inside Outside semete</b>

00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:51.050
<i>Inside Outside attack</i>

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:53.420
<b>Issai gassai nuite</b>

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:53.420
<i>Surpass everything altogether</i>

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:55.570
<b>Dare hitori monani hitotsu mo</b>

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:58.050
<i>I won’t let no one and nothing go forward</i>

00:00:55.570 --> 00:00:58.050
<b>Mae wo ikasetaku wa nai</b>

00:00:58.050 --> 00:01:00.430
<b>Inside Outside GO! SONIC!!</b>

00:00:58.050 --> 00:01:00.430
<i>Inside Outside, Go! Sonic!!</i>

00:01:00.430 --> 00:01:02.850
<b>Issai gassai Yes! SONIC!!</b>

00:01:00.430 --> 00:01:02.850
<i>Everything altogether Yes! Sonic!!</i>

00:01:02.850 --> 00:01:05.890
<b>Abunai yo to Have A Nice wa niteru</b>

00:01:02.850 --> 00:01:05.890
<i>“Watch out” and “Have a nice” are similar</i>

00:01:05.890 --> 00:01:08.650
<b>Soudochira mo kamihitoe na no sa</b>

00:01:05.890 --> 00:01:08.650
<i>That’s right – both are by the skin of your teeth</i>

00:01:08.650 --> 00:01:16.660
<b>Taikutsu nugisuteteima sugu kakedase</b>

00:01:08.650 --> 00:01:16.660
<i>Throw boredom away and start running right now</i>

00:01:20.530 --> 00:01:22.410
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:22.740 --> 00:01:24.750
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:28.920
<b>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</b>

00:01:31.020 --> 00:01:32.480
Hey.

00:01:32.570 --> 00:01:35.280
C'mon, wake up.

00:01:35.400 --> 00:01:37.200
Wake up.

00:01:43.080 --> 00:01:45.660
Wake up!

00:01:47.870 --> 00:01:52.000
Wake up! I said wake up!

00:01:52.340 --> 00:01:54.380
Hurry and wake up!

00:01:54.380 --> 00:01:59.300
I'll make you my servant, so wake up! Hurry and wake up!

00:02:07.180 --> 00:02:12.400
We have to carry out an important mission.

00:02:15.740 --> 00:02:17.990
I'll let you be my servant.

00:02:17.990 --> 00:02:21.120
You have to do whatever I tell you.

00:02:24.490 --> 00:02:27.790
It's great that you're obedient! Come with me.

00:02:33.500 --> 00:02:36.510
Come this way, my servant!

00:02:48.230 --> 00:02:50.480
I'm going to run wild today!

00:02:51.480 --> 00:02:54.730
Let's go!

00:02:58.340 --> 00:03:03.350
Episode 42

00:02:58.340 --> 00:03:03.350
Amy, Love's Escape Journey!?

00:03:04.490 --> 00:03:09.290
In City Park, people have been jogging since the early morning.

00:03:09.290 --> 00:03:12.080
Our hero Sonic saved the world again.

00:03:12.080 --> 00:03:17.210
Admiring Sonic's speed, jogging has become the latest fad.

00:03:17.210 --> 00:03:19.920
Are you jogging because you admire Sonic?

00:03:19.920 --> 00:03:24.470
Yeah. I can't run as fast as him, but it feels good to run.

00:03:24.680 --> 00:03:27.970
This fad has even spread to the world of track and field.

00:03:27.970 --> 00:03:32.480
New world records are constantly being broken in competitions around the world.

00:03:32.480 --> 00:03:35.400
Sports science experts say that this is due to-

00:03:35.400 --> 00:03:37.150
Sonic!

00:03:37.940 --> 00:03:39.150
What?

00:03:39.150 --> 00:03:40.490
Amy?

00:03:40.860 --> 00:03:42.950
Sonic, you can't hide from me!

00:03:42.950 --> 00:03:44.660
Hurry up and show yourself!

00:03:44.910 --> 00:03:46.200
What's wrong, Amy?

00:03:46.910 --> 00:03:51.710
Sonic, if you don't come out right now, I'm going to beat up Chris!

00:03:52.040 --> 00:03:54.210
Amy?

00:03:54.330 --> 00:03:56.040
Please don't!

00:03:58.960 --> 00:04:01.050
So he's not here...

00:04:04.260 --> 00:04:06.050
Why did you do that?

00:04:06.050 --> 00:04:08.510
Amy, you scared me!

00:04:09.720 --> 00:04:11.730
Are you okay? I'm sorry.

00:04:11.730 --> 00:04:13.640
But I'm also serious.

00:04:13.640 --> 00:04:14.850
What do you mean?

00:04:14.850 --> 00:04:17.480
Did something happen between you and Sonic?

00:04:17.480 --> 00:04:20.570
Sonic...

00:04:22.110 --> 00:04:25.780
I think I said something that I shouldn't have.

00:04:25.780 --> 00:04:29.990
Amy, will you please calm down and explain what's going on?

00:04:30.200 --> 00:04:31.830
Sonic...

00:04:31.830 --> 00:04:37.330
Sonic stood me up!

00:04:39.590 --> 00:04:41.300
Is that all?

00:04:42.010 --> 00:04:43.920
What do you mean by that?

00:04:44.010 --> 00:04:45.840
Because...

00:04:45.840 --> 00:04:47.890
We were supposed to go on a date!

00:04:47.890 --> 00:04:50.100
He promised to go on a date with me awhile back!

00:04:50.100 --> 00:04:53.770
I bought new shoes and a ribbon just for today!

00:04:53.810 --> 00:04:56.060
Shoes?

00:04:57.900 --> 00:04:59.820
It's true.

00:04:59.940 --> 00:05:04.200
But Sonic didn't show up at the spot where we promised to meet!

00:05:04.280 --> 00:05:06.950
I'm sure Sonic has his reasons.

00:05:06.950 --> 00:05:08.570
What reasons?

00:05:08.620 --> 00:05:10.120
Umm, for example...

00:05:10.120 --> 00:05:13.410
Oh yeah! Maybe he's fighting against one of Eggman's robots!

00:05:13.410 --> 00:05:15.790
Eggman's in jail.

00:05:15.920 --> 00:05:17.080
That's right.

00:05:17.080 --> 00:05:19.250
Don't try to humor me.

00:05:19.250 --> 00:05:22.510
Anyway, can you get off the table?

00:05:24.380 --> 00:05:25.760
Sonic?

00:05:25.800 --> 00:05:28.300
Sonic!

00:05:28.930 --> 00:05:30.760
Sonic!

00:05:31.470 --> 00:05:33.520
Is Sonic here?

00:05:33.520 --> 00:05:36.890
As promised, this is my latest vehicle that travels at the speed of sound.

00:05:38.940 --> 00:05:42.610
I greatly refurbished the driving system of this machine.

00:05:42.610 --> 00:05:45.780
It can even change form depending on the driving conditions.

00:05:45.780 --> 00:05:49.570
Isn't it amazing? Say that it's amazing!

00:05:51.160 --> 00:05:52.910
Uncle...

00:05:53.120 --> 00:05:54.910
Chris, where's Sonic?

00:05:54.910 --> 00:05:58.670
He promised to race me today awhile ago.

00:06:04.800 --> 00:06:07.340
What's wrong, young lady?

00:06:07.840 --> 00:06:13.470
Sonic, you idiot!

00:06:15.270 --> 00:06:17.390
And that's why Amy's upset.

00:06:17.390 --> 00:06:22.900
I see. In other words, Sonic stood us both up.

00:06:23.020 --> 00:06:24.980
I'm sure he has his reasons.

00:06:24.980 --> 00:06:27.700
He's totally forgotten about me.

00:06:27.700 --> 00:06:30.320
After all, he made plans with someone else on the same day.

00:06:30.320 --> 00:06:31.780
Amy...

00:06:32.320 --> 00:06:36.080
It's true that Sonic never cares about the little things.

00:06:36.080 --> 00:06:39.830
I can understand because I forget quickly too.

00:06:41.420 --> 00:06:42.710
Uncle!

00:06:42.790 --> 00:06:43.880
I've made my decision!

00:06:46.050 --> 00:06:48.970
Since he stood us both up, why don't we go on a date instead?

00:06:48.970 --> 00:06:50.300
Amy!

00:06:50.470 --> 00:06:53.470
Take me somewhere right this minute!

00:06:56.970 --> 00:07:01.270
Okay, Miss. Since he forgot about us, we'll have a good time together.

00:07:01.440 --> 00:07:03.020
You too, Uncle?

00:07:03.020 --> 00:07:05.480
Don't worry. We'll be back by nighttime.

00:07:05.480 --> 00:07:08.400
I leave fast, but I also return fast.

00:07:11.240 --> 00:07:12.490
Is this okay?

00:07:12.490 --> 00:07:16.540
Did Sonic really forget that he made appointments with both of them?

00:07:16.540 --> 00:07:20.370
Sonic is really busy these days...

00:07:20.960 --> 00:07:22.250
That's horrible!

00:07:22.500 --> 00:07:26.750
Hey! Cream, why are you also angry?

00:07:39.430 --> 00:07:42.770
Sonic is too self-centered.

00:07:42.940 --> 00:07:45.520
The wind is refreshing and nice.

00:07:45.520 --> 00:07:50.900
He always runs off to wherever he wants to go and leaves me behind.

00:07:50.900 --> 00:07:54.820
The engine is working perfectly. My new machine is impressive.

00:07:55.490 --> 00:08:00.450
He can't understand the feelings of those who can't catch up to him.

00:08:02.620 --> 00:08:06.790
Curves! I can show off my driving skills!

00:08:06.840 --> 00:08:09.090
Are you listening to me?

00:08:09.170 --> 00:08:10.840
Then why don't you give up?

00:08:10.970 --> 00:08:11.880
What?

00:08:17.550 --> 00:08:20.310
If you don't think you can catch up to him, then give up.

00:08:20.640 --> 00:08:23.890
If it's not going to work, then you can deal with it by forgetting the whole thing.

00:08:24.060 --> 00:08:27.270
But it might not be definitely over.

00:08:30.570 --> 00:08:33.030
I fall in love quickly, but I also forget quickly.

00:08:33.030 --> 00:08:35.490
That's one of my positive traits.

00:08:37.490 --> 00:08:40.540
It was stupid of me to discuss with you about how girls feel.

00:08:40.540 --> 00:08:42.000
So where are we going?

00:08:42.000 --> 00:08:42.830
The beach!

00:08:42.830 --> 00:08:44.500
At this time of year?

00:08:44.500 --> 00:08:47.880
It's common knowledge that girls who get dumped go to the beach!

00:08:47.960 --> 00:08:49.340
All right!

00:08:49.340 --> 00:08:53.590
Princess, enjoy my graceful driving techniques down the coastline.

00:08:53.590 --> 00:08:56.220
Thanks, umm... What was your name again?

00:08:56.220 --> 00:08:59.430
Supersonic Knight? Runaway Express of Love?

00:08:59.430 --> 00:09:01.770
You can call me Sam today.

00:09:07.940 --> 00:09:09.900
I want seconds!

00:09:15.650 --> 00:09:17.780
This isn't enough!

00:09:18.030 --> 00:09:19.740
We want seconds too!

00:09:19.740 --> 00:09:21.740
Hurry up and bring some more!

00:09:21.950 --> 00:09:25.830
You just had seconds! Restrain yourselves!

00:09:26.000 --> 00:09:32.590
My super genius brain requires three times the energy of a normal person.

00:09:32.590 --> 00:09:34.760
I'll sue you for human rights violations!

00:09:34.760 --> 00:09:37.090
The evil detention officer is bullying us!

00:09:37.090 --> 00:09:38.220
Be quiet!

00:09:38.220 --> 00:09:41.600
Fine! Eat as much as you want!

00:09:43.060 --> 00:09:45.560
That's what you should have done in the first place.

00:09:47.020 --> 00:09:49.980
This place is wonderful.

00:09:49.980 --> 00:09:54.230
We can eat as much as we like, and there's a heating system. It's paradise.

00:09:54.230 --> 00:09:58.490
But we can't continue to live like this, Dr. Eggman.

00:09:59.660 --> 00:10:02.910
Don't worry. I already have a plan.

00:10:04.080 --> 00:10:07.710
They'll come to rescue us soon.

00:10:09.330 --> 00:10:10.790
Sheesh...

00:10:18.180 --> 00:10:21.180
You can't escape from us!

00:10:32.020 --> 00:10:36.320
I'm going to defeat Sonic today! Charge!

00:10:38.320 --> 00:10:39.400
Fire!

00:10:43.120 --> 00:10:44.580
Another!

00:10:50.870 --> 00:10:52.330
Fire!

00:10:59.300 --> 00:11:01.050
I did it!

00:11:04.010 --> 00:11:05.970
Wait!

00:11:06.720 --> 00:11:07.850
Take that!

00:11:08.310 --> 00:11:09.390
And that!

00:11:10.390 --> 00:11:12.400
Wait!

00:11:20.820 --> 00:11:22.700
Hey!

00:11:25.660 --> 00:11:28.830
I thought we were going to the beach!

00:11:29.160 --> 00:11:31.290
It seems I became a little lost.

00:11:31.290 --> 00:11:33.540
Hurry up and turn the car around!

00:11:33.540 --> 00:11:35.000
Don't get impatient, Miss.

00:11:35.000 --> 00:11:38.010
If we keep going straight, we'll eventually reach the beach.

00:11:41.720 --> 00:11:43.890
I'm going home!

00:12:01.950 --> 00:12:03.360
Please give me a map.

00:12:03.990 --> 00:12:07.240
Did you run through the desert?

00:12:07.240 --> 00:12:08.620
Yeah.

00:12:10.250 --> 00:12:14.170
Don't worry about a map. You're too serious.

00:12:14.170 --> 00:12:16.000
I want to go to the beach!

00:12:16.000 --> 00:12:19.460
I'm sick and tired of the desert, the ranch, the mountains and the forest!

00:12:19.460 --> 00:12:21.720
There's a leaf in your hair.

00:12:24.760 --> 00:12:28.720
Your car is your pride and joy, isn't it? So you should at least install a navigation system!

00:12:28.720 --> 00:12:30.720
I like to drive.

00:12:30.720 --> 00:12:33.730
Arriving at a destination isn't important.

00:12:35.230 --> 00:12:37.270
You're just like Sonic.

00:12:37.270 --> 00:12:40.110
So you really are Sonic's friends!

00:12:40.110 --> 00:12:42.740
I thought you looked familiar.

00:12:42.740 --> 00:12:47.370
Yes, I'm Sonic's girlfriend.

00:12:47.410 --> 00:12:49.490
But he stood her up.

00:12:50.830 --> 00:12:52.370
Ouch!

00:12:52.500 --> 00:12:55.670
Sonic saved my grandson's life.

00:12:55.670 --> 00:12:57.880
Your grandson?

00:12:59.090 --> 00:13:00.550
Grandpa!

00:13:00.550 --> 00:13:02.920
Stop!

00:13:09.810 --> 00:13:12.520
Help me!

00:13:23.150 --> 00:13:24.110
Steven!

00:13:24.110 --> 00:13:25.070
Grandpa!

00:13:25.070 --> 00:13:25.990
Thank goodness!

00:13:25.990 --> 00:13:28.910
I was scared!

00:13:29.280 --> 00:13:31.200
I see...

00:13:31.200 --> 00:13:35.250
It seems like you went through a lot, but my family always rooted for you.

00:13:35.250 --> 00:13:37.920
Because Sonic is our hero.

00:13:37.920 --> 00:13:41.590
Here's the map, and take this too.

00:13:45.670 --> 00:13:48.760
Give my regards to Sonic!

00:13:59.560 --> 00:14:01.860
It's full of candy.

00:14:04.900 --> 00:14:08.320
He gave you a gift, but you're still in a bad mood.

00:14:08.820 --> 00:14:11.070
Sonic is the one who should've received this.

00:14:11.070 --> 00:14:14.910
For Sonic, helping people is common practice.

00:14:14.910 --> 00:14:17.460
I doubt he remembers the incident.

00:14:18.040 --> 00:14:20.500
The one who was rescued remembers.

00:14:20.500 --> 00:14:24.500
He's usually impolite, but when he sees people in trouble, he can't stop himself from helping them.

00:14:24.500 --> 00:14:29.760
He's actually very kind, so it's natural that everyone likes Sonic.

00:14:29.760 --> 00:14:32.680
I don't think Sonic will be angry if you eat that candy.

00:14:32.680 --> 00:14:35.020
But Sonic belongs to no one.

00:14:35.020 --> 00:14:37.140
He won't turn around and look at me.

00:14:37.980 --> 00:14:40.230
Even if I chase after him, I can't catch him.

00:14:40.900 --> 00:14:43.520
By the way, about the appointment I made with Sonic...

00:14:43.730 --> 00:14:45.690
I made a mistake.

00:14:46.490 --> 00:14:50.200
I just remembered that the race will begin at sunset.

00:14:50.410 --> 00:14:54.200
So my date didn't overlap with your race?

00:14:54.200 --> 00:15:00.580
I couldn't wait to race because I was so excited, so I mistakenly thought the race was in the morning.

00:15:13.050 --> 00:15:14.680
So I'm the only one he stood up?

00:15:14.680 --> 00:15:18.680
He's probably practicing somewhere to prepare for our race.

00:15:18.980 --> 00:15:21.230
It must be nice to be so carefree.

00:15:21.230 --> 00:15:23.520
People say to me, "Why don't you just drive for the rest of your life!"

00:15:23.520 --> 00:15:25.020
Or "I can't keep up with you!"

00:15:25.020 --> 00:15:27.530
Or "I can't wait for you forever!"

00:15:30.110 --> 00:15:32.070
I feel the same way.

00:15:34.870 --> 00:15:37.160
I'm not letting you escape!

00:15:37.540 --> 00:15:38.790
Take this!

00:15:46.960 --> 00:15:48.420
Here I come, kid!

00:15:48.800 --> 00:15:50.260
Please stop!

00:16:02.730 --> 00:16:05.190
All right! He's over there! Go!

00:16:19.490 --> 00:16:23.580
Thanks to you, I'm late for my appointment!

00:16:32.380 --> 00:16:35.340
You fool! I tricked you, Sonic!

00:16:35.340 --> 00:16:39.640
Right now, the other machine is freeing Dr. Eggman!

00:16:48.610 --> 00:16:50.230
The other machine?

00:17:00.450 --> 00:17:02.580
I do understand.

00:17:03.330 --> 00:17:07.670
Sonic will never stay with me because he loves to run.

00:17:07.670 --> 00:17:08.710
Want to eat this?

00:17:08.710 --> 00:17:10.000
Thank you.

00:17:13.550 --> 00:17:15.380
It's the same with you, isn't it?

00:17:15.380 --> 00:17:19.350
Me? Well, if I could run like him, I'd be happy.

00:17:19.600 --> 00:17:23.310
But unfortunately, I have to rely on vehicles.

00:17:23.730 --> 00:17:27.770
You'll never catch up to Sonic in this kind of car.

00:17:28.100 --> 00:17:29.980
Maybe.

00:17:31.400 --> 00:17:32.980
But you still drive?

00:17:32.980 --> 00:17:35.450
Because that's my dream.

00:17:36.530 --> 00:17:38.620
Same here.

00:17:46.920 --> 00:17:49.170
Understood. I'll stay on its tail.

00:17:49.170 --> 00:17:53.210
It's heading towards the town where Eggman is imprisoned.

00:17:53.510 --> 00:17:56.720
So that means Eggman created that machine.

00:17:57.880 --> 00:18:01.890
If it charges into town, the town will be destroyed!

00:18:02.560 --> 00:18:03.930
Sam!

00:18:05.060 --> 00:18:09.400
Miss, we're not superheroes like Sonic.

00:18:09.810 --> 00:18:12.190
But we have to do whatever we can!

00:18:12.190 --> 00:18:15.030
Okay, hang on tight!

00:18:17.200 --> 00:18:19.410
Mode change!

00:18:20.160 --> 00:18:22.280
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:18:22.450 --> 00:18:24.240
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:18:24.790 --> 00:18:27.330
<b>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</b>

00:18:34.210 --> 00:18:37.840
This is the true form of my new super machine!

00:18:34.300 --> 00:18:39.050
<b>Kinou made no ruuru kyou wa tada no ruuzu</b>

00:18:34.300 --> 00:18:39.050
<i>Yesterday’s rules are simply loose today</i>

00:18:37.840 --> 00:18:39.430
No way!

00:18:39.050 --> 00:18:43.350
<b>Kowashite dantotsu gooru</b>

00:18:39.050 --> 00:18:43.350
